{"id":"n64371-5-8","stage":1,"title":"남기다 · 留下","scene":"家庭与继承","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n64371-5-8-1","ko":"승규가 이번에 할아버지께 유산을 받았다면서요?","zh":"听说承奎这次从爷爷那里继承了遗产？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"승규가","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}],"sources":[],"surfaceReading":{"term":"승규가","audio":"/audio/035e382cdd18f08ebfad.mp3"}},{"text":"이번에","meaning":"这次，这回","explanation":"이번：这次，这回；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"이번","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"29737","senseId":"1","lemma":"이번","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이번에","audio":"/audio/46d83053c21d45a8f49f.mp3"}},{"text":"할아버지께","meaning":"从爷爷那里","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷；-께 在 받다 等动词前标记受尊敬的来源，这里相当于“从爷爷那里”。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지께","audio":"/audio/4ced95a17475d2e68459.mp3"}},{"text":"유산을","meaning":"遗产","explanation":"유산：遗产；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"유산","audio":"/audio/4d0c13c05376b3861fc4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27114","senseId":"1","lemma":"유산","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"유산을","audio":"/audio/fcfaf547f4881c49b9ad.mp3"}},{"text":"받았다면서요?","meaning":"继承、得到","explanation":"받다：得到；유산을 받다 指得到或继承遗产。-았다면서요? 向对方确认听来的消息。","readings":[{"term":"받다","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66636","senseId":"1","lemma":"받다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"받았다면서요","audio":"/audio/48ef2fa8c9be8ca26674.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"da78d4146f0588e8","term":"이번","zh":"这次，这回","audio":"/audio/da78d4146f0588e8450a.mp3","entryId":"29737","definition":"马上到来的顺序；或指刚过去的顺序。","pronunciation":["이번"]},{"id":"6600340ce9e158e7","term":"할아버지","zh":"爷爷，姥爷","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3","entryId":"74121","definition":"用于指称或称呼父亲的父亲或母亲的父亲。","pronunciation":["하라버지"]},{"id":"4d0c13c05376b386","term":"유산","zh":"遗产","audio":"/audio/4d0c13c05376b3861fc4.mp3","entryId":"27114","definition":"死去的人留下的财产。","pronunciation":["유산"]},{"id":"5af01487318c0c57","term":"받다","zh":"继承、得到","audio":"/audio/5af01487318c0c571462.mp3","entryId":"66636","definition":"接受来自别人的东西；유산을 받다 在本句指继承遗产。","pronunciation":["받따"]}],"audio":"/audio/34e8989f4ab4c64e5408.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n64371-5-8-2","ko":"할아버지께서 땅을 좀 남기고 돌아가셨나 봐요.","zh":"看来爷爷去世时留了一些地吧。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"할아버지께서","meaning":"爷爷，姥爷","explanation":"할아버지：爷爷，姥爷；께서：이/가 的敬语形式，标记受到尊敬的主语。","readings":[{"term":"할아버지","audio":"/audio/6600340ce9e158e7d903.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74121","senseId":"1","lemma":"할아버지","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"할아버지께서","audio":"/audio/8d394502e3ec4be9e917.mp3"}},{"text":"땅을","meaning":"地皮，宅基地，土地","explanation":"땅：地皮，宅基地，土地；을：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"땅","audio":"/audio/f330041e9e005a6bf8b4.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"30206","senseId":"4","lemma":"땅","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"땅을","audio":"/audio/0b105703b0ee529638f6.mp3"}},{"text":"좀","meaning":"一点点，有一点","explanation":"좀：一点点，有一点。","readings":[{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75798","senseId":"1","lemma":"좀","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"좀","audio":"/audio/70ae9bc35b2d378b00ef.mp3"}},{"text":"남기고","meaning":"留传，留下","explanation":"남기다：留传，留下；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"남기다","audio":"/audio/a129ccc910d85b760984.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64371","senseId":"5","lemma":"남기다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"남기고","audio":"/audio/8d6e5f2383a9ba5ff8fa.mp3"}},{"text":"돌아가셨나","meaning":"去世，逝世","explanation":"돌아가다：去世，逝世；시：主